ietiao:p008","quote":"朓及殷叡素與梁武以文章相得，帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨。及帝爲雍州，二女並暫隨母向州。及武帝即位，二主始隨內還。武帝意薄謨，又以門單，欲更適張弘策子，弘策卒，又以與王志子諲。而謨不堪歎恨，爲書狀如詩贈主。主以呈帝，甚蒙矜歎，而婦終不得還。尋用謨爲信安縣，稍遷王府諮議。時以爲沈約早與朓善，爲制此書雲。","source_term":"帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"原文直接記梁武帝大女或第二女，又以梁書郗后傳覆核公主姓名。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-ws1477957","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0041","c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0087"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0041","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0041"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0087","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family:p004:m0087"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd1739","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0034","c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0072"],"paragraph_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0034","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0034"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0072","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-022-wangyun-family-wyd:p004:m0072"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_oc